SUMMARY:Paint and Sip
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC Child and Family Services and Professionals with Pride for an evening of wine\, painting\, and community; all in support of TLC’s LGBTQ+ youth affirming services. \nYou’ll create a guided painting of the Sonoma County moonlit sky while sipping wine provided by La Crema Winery. No painting experience necessary\, just show up and have fun!\nEach ticket includes two drink tickets and a canvas to take home. All supplies are provided. \nChoose the ticketing tier that works for you. \n📅 Thursday\, May 28 | 5:30–7:30 PM\n📍TLC’s Main Campus: 1800 Hwy 116 N.\, Sebastopol\, CA \nGet your tickets!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/paint-and-sip/
LOCATION:TLC Child and Family Services\, 1800 Hwy 116 N\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
END:VEVENT
