SUMMARY:Velocity Invitational
DESCRIPTION:Velocity Invitational\, America’s premier motorsports and lifestyle event\, returns to Sonoma Raceway May 29–31\, 2026\, bringing together vintage racing\, rare collector cars\, modern supercars\, and luxury hospitality for an unforgettable weekend. Guests can enjoy world-class racing\, open paddock access\, driver meet-and-greets\, gourmet food and wine\, live entertainment\, and premium hospitality experiences. \nThe weekend event runs from 9am on Friday\, May 29 through 6pm on Sunday\, May 31 at Sonoma Raceway. A range of ticket options are available\, including single-day and weekend passes\, family and couple bundles\, and premium hospitality packages\, along with add-ons such as Friday VIP access\, parking\, and camping. Tickets start at $159 plus taxes and fees. For full details and to purchase\, visit viavelocity.com.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/velocity-invitational-2/
LOCATION:Sonoma Raceway\, 29355 Arnold Dr.\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Recreation
