SUMMARY:Season 22 Adult Shows – School of Rock Santa Rosa
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an unforgettable night of live music as our incredible Adult Bands take the stage for Season 22 Adult Shows! \nGet ready for an unforgettable night of live music as our incredible Adult Bands take the stage for Season 22 Adult Shows! \nSix powerhouse adult bands will be performing\, bringing months of hard work\, rehearsals\, and pure passion to life. These aren’t just casual jam sessions. Our adult musicians commit to weekly rehearsals\, private lessons\, and full band collaboration to deliver high energy\, professional level performances. \nFrom classic rock anthems to modern hits\, you’ll hear a dynamic mix of genres\, killer guitar solos\, tight rhythm sections\, powerful vocals\, and the kind of stage presence that proves it’s never too late to rock. \nWhether you’re a longtime supporter\, a friend or family member\, or just someone who loves live music\, this show is for you. \nOur Adult Program is built for musicians 18+ of all skill levels. From those picking up an instrument for the first time to seasoned players looking to get back on stage. Season 22 is a celebration of growth\, confidence\, and the power of playing music together. \nCome cheer them on and experience what makes School of Rock Santa Rosa such a special community.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/season-22-adult-shows-school-of-rock-santa-rosa/
