SUMMARY:UltraBomb with Boss' Daughter + Redwood Chrome at WonderStump
DESCRIPTION:Legendary punk supergroup UltraBomb is hitting WonderStump in Petaluma on their 2026 North American tour! Catch songs from their new record\, Look Forward In Anger\, live and loud. This is your chance to experience the sound of genre-shaping musicians in a venue built for close-up\, immersive shows. \nUltraBomb is comprised of punk rock veterans: Greg Norton (Hüsker Dü) — bass\, vocals • Derek O’Brien (Social Distortion\, Agent Orange\, Adolescents) — drums\, vocals • Ryan Smith (Soul Asylum) — guitar\, vocals \nJoining them are Boss’ Daughter straight out of Reno\, and hometown heroes Redwood Chrome. \nDoors open at 6 ⎸ $22.50 presale or $27.50 day of show\, if capacity allows. This is a 21+ event. Valid ID required for entry.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/ultrabomb-with-boss-daughter-redwood-chrome-at-wonderstump/
