SUMMARY:Off the Perch + Sloan Irving
DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\nDoors at 7:30pm.\nShow from 8:15-10:30pm with one intermission\nEarlybirds!\n$3 off each ticket when you use the code earlybird18 at checkout. Offer ends May 24th.\nPromo Codes are not applicable at the door.\nCodes are not case sensitive\, but must be typed as one word. \nOff the Perch is a dynamic trio that blends contemporary song writing with the heartbeat of folk tradition.\nAt its core\, the group weaves acoustic instruments into rich\, living textures that evolve into electric soundscapes\, evoking the California North Bay’s vast expanse of forest\, field\, and sea.\nTheir music rises from the earth yet reaches for the unknown — rooted in craft\, lifted by lush harmonies\, and driven by original compositions offered by each member.\nWith every performance\, Off the Perch invites listeners into a space where time bends\, the duality of beauty and pain intertwine\, and where the shared pulse of the human experience becomes a transcendent celebration. \nSloan Irving is a 23 year old singer songwriter from Petaluma. She pulls inspiration from many genres such as americana\, soul\, and indie rock while leaning heavily into her love of simple but haunting folk melodies and her desire to capture many sides of the human experience through her storytelling.\nhttps://www.facebook.com/sloan.irving\nhttps://www.instagram.com/sloanirving\nhttps://youtube.com/channel/UCdoDaLRShGCwVOC8RIfTnTw
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/off-the-perch-sloan-irving/
LOCATION:The Lost Church Santa Rosa\, 576 Ross Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.44222;-122.71561
